Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: top-down miniature racing game
 Pint-Size Prix is a top-down racing game in which thumb-sized vehicles
 race across everyday places: a breakfast table, a woodworking bench, a
 freezer drawer, a sink full of dishes, an office desk and a backyard
 sandbox.
 .
 Each course has its own vehicle and handling, with table edges to fall
 from, jumps across gaps and spills that change your grip. The game offers
 a tournament against computer drivers, head-to-head races against the
 computer or a second player on the same keyboard, and a time trial.
 .
 All graphics and sound are generated by the game while it runs.
